msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:244
msgid "Problem: Tool call spam on WhatsApp/Telegram"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:246
msgid ""
"By default, Hermes forwards every tool call execution as a progress "
"message to messaging platforms (WhatsApp, Telegram). These look like:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:247
msgid "\"🐍 execute_code: \\\"from hermes_tools import...\\\"\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:248
msgid "\"🔧 terminal: grep -rn tool_call...\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:250
msgid ""
"This triggers **WhatsApp spam detection** (getting blocked) and "
"**Telegram rate limiting** (throttled)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:252
msgid "Fix: Disable tool progress on all agents"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:261
msgid "The default is `\"all\"` which sends every tool call. Valid values:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:262
msgid "`\"off\"` — nothing sent (recommended for production)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:263
msgid "`\"new\"` — only shown when tool changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:264
msgid "`\"all\"` — every tool call (default, dangerous for WhatsApp)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:265
msgid "`\"verbose\"` — every tool call with full arguments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:267
msgid ""
"**Apply to all agents:** The setting must be in EACH agent's config.yaml "
"(`~/.hermes/config.yaml` AND `~/hermes_cmd_agentN/config.yaml`). Setting "
"it on the default agent alone won't affect the cmd agents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:269
msgid ""
"**Verify after applying:** Restart the gateway, then check that no emoji-"
"prefixed tool messages appear on WhatsApp/Telegram. Only final plain text"
" responses should be sent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:271
msgid "Code reference"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:272
msgid ""
"`gateway/run.py:6218-6229` — reads `display.tool_progress`, defaults to "
"`\"all\"`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:273
msgid ""
"`gateway/run.py:6229` — `tool_progress_enabled = progress_mode != \"off\""
" and source.platform != Platform.WEBHOOK`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:274
msgid "When `\"off\"`, `progress_queue=None` and `progress_callback` is a no-op"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:275
msgid "Webhook platform is ALWAYS excluded (line 6229)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:277
msgid "Port Conflicts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:279
msgid "Webhook port 8644: Used by default gateway"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:280
msgid "If `port already in use` error: `sudo fuser -k 8644/tcp`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:282
msgid "Config Changes Not Taking Effect"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:284
msgid "The gateway reads config at startup. If you change `config.yaml`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:285
msgid "Kill the gateway: `pkill -f 'hermes gateway run'`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:286
msgid "Clear state: `rm ~/.hermes/gateway_state.json`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:287
msgid "Restart: `bash ~/.hermes/gateway-run.sh &`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:289
msgid "Pitfalls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:291
msgid ""
"**Every new session can spawn a gateway** -- this causes infinite lock "
"ping-pong. Always kill existing gateways before starting a new one."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:292
msgid ""
"**Token truncation in config** -- `.env` values sometimes show as `***` "
"in terminal but the actual file has the real key. Verify with `python3 -c"
" \"print(open('file').read())\"`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:293
msgid ""
"**Stale PIDs in gateway_state.json** -- causes the gateway to think it's "
"still running when it's not. Remove the file to reset."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:294
msgid ""
"**Lock files on disk** -- survive process death. Always clean stale locks"
" when resolving conflicts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hermes-gateway-troubleshooting_SKILL.md:295
msgid ""
"**YAML `enabled: false` must be boolean** -- `'false'` (string) is "
"truthy. Must be `false` (boolean)."
msgstr ""

